WEBVTT

open-release-desk
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.478
Start with the release
workspace in a real browser.

prepare-release
00:00:03.558 --> 00:00:07.458
The synthetic pointer moves
to each declared target.

enter-version
00:00:07.538 --> 00:00:11.213
Camera zoom follows the
same target rectangle.

request-approval
00:00:11.293 --> 00:00:14.718
Submit the release for
a final human decision.

frame-human-review
00:00:14.798 --> 00:00:18.548
PlainTake hands the visible
browser to a person.

approve-release
00:00:21.386 --> 00:00:25.790
The person approves, and the
recorded scenario can continue.

show-approved-state
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:29.620
The final state is visible
and ready to verify.
